# Production endpoint contract for España Outdoor.
# Copy to a deployment secret store; never commit real credentials.
# All public endpoints MUST use HTTPS.

MAP_PMTILES_URL=https://maps.example.com/spain.pmtiles
VALHALLA_BASE_URL=https://routing.example.com
LIVE_DATA_BASE_URL=https://live.example.com
RESCUE_LINK_BASE_URL=https://rescue.example.com
OIDC_ISSUER_URL=https://auth.example.com/realms/espana-outdoor

# Required before production gate:
# - Replace every example.com value with the real controlled endpoint.
# - Verify HTTP 200/healthy responses from an external network.
# - Verify PMTiles supports HTTP Range requests and checksum validation.
# - Verify Valhalla serves Spain pedestrian routes and elevation where configured.
# - Verify Live Data uses real OIDC/AEMET runtime credentials.
# - Verify Rescue Link uses production TLS, OIDC and encrypted storage.
